    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "指标口径",
      "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 0, "w": 24, "h": 5},
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "# v1beta3 TimeGraph 关系查询\n\n`route=\"timegraph\"` 是 v1beta3 关系查询主路径。接口请求量来自 `api_request_total`；旧路由指标描述 multi_resource；共享拓扑使用 cmdb_topology_* 按请求/子查询记录终态，partial 与失败、空结果分别统计；底层 VictoriaMetrics 请求耗时来自 `tsdb_request_seconds`。空结果与失败分开统计，不把无采样当作成功。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "v1beta3 HTTP 请求速率",
      "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 5, "w": 12, "h": 8},
      "datasource": {"type": "bkmonitor-timeseries-datasource", "uid": "000000002"},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "reqps"}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {"legend": {"displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom"}, "tooltip": {"mode": "multi"}},
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "format": "time_series",
          "source": "sum by (api, status) (rate(unify_query_api_request_total{api=~\"/api/v1/relation/v1beta3/(multi_resource|topology).*\"}[5m]))",
          "type": "range",
          "datasource": {"type": "bkmonitor-timeseries-datasource", "uid": "000000002"}
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
